<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cytyc upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cytyc upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said on Thursday it upgraded its rating for Cytyc Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>--said Cytyc formed a marketing alliance with Mead Johnson, a division of Bristol-Myers Squibb, to co-promote the Thinprep pap smear slide preparation.</p>
<p>--said it raised its 12-month target price for Cytyc to $30 from $26.</p>
<p>--Cytyc shares were up 3-5/8 to 23-1/4 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
